  "description": "A single rumor can end a celebrity's career, and Seong Ki-Chan just hit rock bottom. Hounded by scandal, his only lifeline turns out to be Yang Eun-Gi, the supposed victim of his past. But salvation does not come free. Eun-Gi is not looking for an apology or money; he runs a secret adult streaming channel, and he wants Ki-Chan live on set. Trapped between public ruin and private exposure, Ki-Chan agrees to sign on to Eun-Gi's broadcast. Now, as the cameras roll and the heat turns up between them, Ki-Chan must navigate a risky game where every boundary is meant to be broken.\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
